					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2319031#post-2897946</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2319031/it-s-just-paint-right#post-2897946</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 23 Jun 2017 18:58:18 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>phyrestorm</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2027488</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I really like the concept and the images - especially how 173's expression changes after it kills Will and the sequence where Leo closes his eyes - but now I'm wondering why they sent only three D-class in. It would make far more sense to have at least two or three more, which was apparently your original plan, and it wouldn't be that hard to have everyone die anyway. Six guys could still all get distracted when Randall drops his mop, one could lose it because Will was his brother/lover/whatever, one could panic and hide in the corner with his eyes shut, one could turn to yell at Leo when he starts laughing, and Randall having to blink could still be the last straw.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
